{{!
    @template block_socialcomments/pinboard

    The pinboard: the comments a user pinned in a course, alone or with all comments of a page.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * pages - Context of block_socialcomments/overview
    * nopins - Text shown when nothing is pinned (formatted)

    Optional context variables:
    * courseselect - Menu to go to the pinboard of another course (HTML)

    Example context (json):
    {
        "courseselect": "",
        "pages": [],
        "nopins": "There are no pinned comments in Digital photography basics."
    }
}}
<div class="block_socialcomments sc-pinboard">
    {{#courseselect}}<div class="sc-courseselect">{{{courseselect}}}</div>{{/courseselect}}
    {{> block_socialcomments/overview}}
    {{^pages}}<p class="sc-empty">{{{nopins}}}</p>{{/pages}}
</div>
